{"schemaVersion":1,"id":3,"sections":[{"id":"106004-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[40,41,42,43],"start":0,"count":33},{"id":"106004-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10030],"start":33,"count":3},{"id":"106005-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[50,51,52,53],"start":36,"count":20},{"id":"106005-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10040,10041,10042,10043],"start":56,"count":12},{"id":"106006-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[60,61,62,63],"start":68,"count":20},{"id":"106006-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10050,10051,10052,10053],"start":88,"count":8}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:40:2","scriptId":40,"text":"“额……我有个问题，为什么这里没有电？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:40:3","scriptId":40,"text":"“已经停了不止一天了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":3,"right":71,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":61,"speaker":"莱尼·博克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:40:4","scriptId":40,"text":"“关于电力的问题，其实是上个月供电所被战车兽群占领了，这里现在都是用的手动发电机。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":61,"right":71,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:40:5","scriptId":40,"text":"“这可是个大问题，关系到可持续发展啊。我得想想办法。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":61,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":61,"speaker":"莱尼·博克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:40:6","scriptId":40,"text":"“因为人手不足，夺回供电所难度很大。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":61,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:40:7","scriptId":40,"text":"“加上新来的苦力和我这位优秀的指挥官，总会有办法的。”我指了指一边的佐伊。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":61,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:40:8","scriptId":40,"text":"“是新来的战斗力！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:41:2","scriptId":41,"text":"“额……我有个问题，为什么这里没有电？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:41:3","scriptId":41,"text":"“已经停了不止一天了，战车兽攻占了供电所。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":3,"right":71,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1171,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:41:4","scriptId":41,"text":"“虽然没电也能忍耐，但这个基地好像没有备用发电机，只能把供电站的战车兽们轰走了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":1171,"right":71,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:41:5","scriptId":41,"text":"“连续作战会不会影响你们的战斗力啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":1171,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1171,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:41:6","scriptId":41,"text":"“没事，这点小事，根本不会对我造成影响。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":1171,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:41:7","scriptId":41,"text":"“不过我推荐还是先在基地中休息和补给一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":1171,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:41:8","scriptId":41,"text":"“我去拿补给箱。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1171,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:41:9","scriptId":41,"text":"“好吧，稍微休息下也没什么不好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":1171,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:42:2","scriptId":42,"text":"“……这电源开关怎么不管用？坏了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1146,"speaker":"嘉丝莉·鲍恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:42:3","scriptId":42,"text":"“供电所还被战车兽占据着。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":3,"right":1146,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":968,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:42:4","scriptId":42,"text":"“什么？这黑灯瞎火的，没电可不行啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":968,"right":1146,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:42:5","scriptId":42,"text":"“这可是个大问题，关系到可持续发展啊。我得想想办法。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":968,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":968,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:42:6","scriptId":42,"text":"“我们应该马上出发夺回供电所！！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":968,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:42:7","scriptId":42,"text":"“嗯，夺回供电所刻不容缓。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":968,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:42:8","scriptId":42,"text":"（这家伙抢我台词啊……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":968,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:42:9","scriptId":42,"text":"“那稍微补给一下吧，我弹药用掉了不少。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:42:10","scriptId":42,"text":"“没问题，补给以后我们就直接突击供电所。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:43:2","scriptId":43,"text":"“终于到了……这基地有点破啊，开关都是坏的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1170,"speaker":"夏虹萤","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:43:3","scriptId":43,"text":"“看样子，并不是开关的问题，整个基地都没有通电。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":3,"right":1170,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:43:4","scriptId":43,"text":"“是的，但电力装置都没有问题，或许供电所那边出了状况。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":1158,"right":1170,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:43:5","scriptId":43,"text":"“供电所吗？我看看地图……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":1158,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:43:6","scriptId":43,"text":"“离这里并不是很远，可以过去看看。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":1158,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:43:7","scriptId":43,"text":"“嗯，没有电的基地完全就是个空壳，得快点让基地恢复机能。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":1158,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:43:8","scriptId":43,"text":"“出发前补给一下吧，刚才你们都用掉了不少弹药。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:43:9","scriptId":43,"text":"“佐伊说得对，稍作补给再出发，十五分钟后在基地门口集合。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-PROLOGUE:43:10","scriptId":43,"text":"“好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":1158,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-EPILOGUE:10030:1","scriptId":10030,"text":"“偷袭成功了，毫发无伤，我真是太厉害了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":37,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-EPILOGUE:10030:2","scriptId":10030,"text":"“干得漂亮！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":37,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106004-EPILOGUE:10030:3","scriptId":10030,"text":"“哼哼，见识到我的实力了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":37,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:50:2","scriptId":50,"text":"“和刚才一样，要从正面突破应该没戏，我们仍然需要找到一个突袭的缺口。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:50:3","scriptId":50,"text":"“就交给我和小飞象吧，侦察我在行。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":37,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:50:4","scriptId":50,"text":"“还是交给莱尼吧，你这脾气不适合侦察。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":61,"speaker":"莱尼·博克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:50:5","scriptId":50,"text":"“得令！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":61,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:50:6","scriptId":50,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":61,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:51:2","scriptId":51,"text":"“和刚才一样，要从正面突破应该没戏，我们仍然需要找到一个突袭的缺口。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":61,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:51:3","scriptId":51,"text":"“就交给我和小飞象吧，侦察我在行。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":37,"right":61,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:51:4","scriptId":51,"text":"“还是交给拉伊莎吧，你这脾气不适合侦察。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":61,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":71,"speaker":"拉伊莎·斯大林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:51:5","scriptId":51,"text":"“没问题！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":71,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:51:6","scriptId":51,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":71,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:52:2","scriptId":52,"text":"“和刚才一样，要从正面突破应该没戏，我们仍然需要找到一个突袭的缺口。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":71,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:52:3","scriptId":52,"text":"“就交给我和小飞象吧，侦察我在行。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":37,"right":71,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:52:4","scriptId":52,"text":"“还是交给嘉丝莉吧，你这脾气不适合侦察。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":71,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1146,"speaker":"嘉丝莉·鲍恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:52:5","scriptId":52,"text":"“知道了，我会谨慎处理。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1146,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:52:6","scriptId":52,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":1146,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:53:2","scriptId":53,"text":"“和刚才一样，要从正面突破应该没戏，我们仍然需要找到一个突袭的缺口。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1146,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:53:3","scriptId":53,"text":"“就交给我和小飞象吧，侦察我在行。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":37,"right":1146,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:53:4","scriptId":53,"text":"“还是交给夏虹萤吧，你这脾气不适合侦察。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1146,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1170,"speaker":"夏虹萤","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:53:5","scriptId":53,"text":"“了解，即刻出发。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1170,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-PROLOGUE:53:6","scriptId":53,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":1170,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":61,"speaker":"莱尼·博克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10040:1","scriptId":10040,"text":"“突破口已经确保，准备进入电站。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":61,"right":1170,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10040:2","scriptId":10040,"text":"“准备突击！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":61,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10040:3","scriptId":10040,"text":"“那个……把你的小飞象管管好，等我命令OK？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10041:1","scriptId":10041,"text":"“虽然外围已经干掉了不少战车兽，但设施内可能还有残余。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":163,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10041:2","scriptId":10041,"text":"“准备突击！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":163,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10041:3","scriptId":10041,"text":"“那个……把你的小飞象管管好，等我命令OK？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":968,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10042:1","scriptId":10042,"text":"“门口的敌人已经全灭，跟我冲。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":968,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10042:2","scriptId":10042,"text":"“准备突击！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":968,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10042:3","scriptId":10042,"text":"“那个……把你的小飞象管管好，等我命令OK？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1170,"speaker":"夏虹萤","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10043:1","scriptId":10043,"text":"“电站已经确保，随时可以进入。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1170,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10043:2","scriptId":10043,"text":"“准备突击！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1170,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106005-EPILOGUE:10043:3","scriptId":10043,"text":"“那个……把你的小飞象管管好，等我命令OK？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":32,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:60:2","scriptId":60,"text":"“我的眼睛没出毛病吧，看看那只战车兽，它正在修理电路，有没有搞错啊，这玩意智商那么高？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":32,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":39,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:60:3","scriptId":60,"text":"“那是不是可以说明，电路都不会修的您连猴子都不如啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":39,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:60:4","scriptId":60,"text":"“少贫嘴。莱尼，等下战斗的时候，仔细观察这只战车兽的动向。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":39,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":61,"speaker":"莱尼·博克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:60:5","scriptId":60,"text":"“好的，捕捉就交给我吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":61,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:60:6","scriptId":60,"text":"“是观察……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":61,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:61:2","scriptId":61,"text":"“我的眼睛没出毛病吧，看看那只战车兽，它正在修理电路，有没有搞错啊，这玩意智商那么高？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":61,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":39,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:61:3","scriptId":61,"text":"“那是不是可以说明，电路都不会修的您连猴子都不如啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":39,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:61:4","scriptId":61,"text":"“少贫嘴。卓娅，等下战斗的时候，仔细观察这只战车兽的动向。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":39,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1171,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:61:5","scriptId":61,"text":"“好的，给它两个过肩摔肯定就老实了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1171,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:61:6","scriptId":61,"text":"“是观察……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1171,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:62:2","scriptId":62,"text":"“我的眼睛没出毛病吧，看看那只战车兽，它正在修理电路，有没有搞错啊，这玩意智商那么高？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1171,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":39,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:62:3","scriptId":62,"text":"“那是不是可以说明，电路都不会修的您连猴子都不如啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":39,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:62:4","scriptId":62,"text":"“少贫嘴。索菲，等下战斗的时候，仔细观察这只战车兽的动向。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":39,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":968,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:62:5","scriptId":62,"text":"“好的，我会尽量把它打成半死的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":968,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:62:6","scriptId":62,"text":"“是观察……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":968,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:63:2","scriptId":63,"text":"“我的眼睛没出毛病吧，看看那只战车兽，它正在修理电路，有没有搞错啊，这玩意智商那么高？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":968,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":39,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:63:3","scriptId":63,"text":"“那是不是可以说明，电路都不会修的您连猴子都不如啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":39,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:63:4","scriptId":63,"text":"“少贫嘴。陈雯兰，等下战斗的时候，仔细观察这只战车兽的动向。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":39,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:63:5","scriptId":63,"text":"“我怕失手会把它给灭了……毕竟控制力道这种事情我不在行。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1158,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-PROLOGUE:63:6","scriptId":63,"text":"“是观察……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":1158,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":61,"speaker":"莱尼·博克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-EPILOGUE:10050:1","scriptId":10050,"text":"“报告长官，那只战车兽的动作确实有些异样，行为方式更接近于人类。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":61,"right":1158,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-EPILOGUE:10050:2","scriptId":10050,"text":"“这下有些棘手了，这里的战车兽开始发生变异了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":61,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-EPILOGUE:10051:1","scriptId":10051,"text":"“有形迹可疑的战车兽，行为方式和人类相似。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":163,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-EPILOGUE:10051:2","scriptId":10051,"text":"“这下有些棘手了，这里的战车兽开始发生变异了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":163,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":968,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-EPILOGUE:10052:1","scriptId":10052,"text":"“那只战车兽的动作有点像人类啊？有点好笑啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":968,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-EPILOGUE:10052:2","scriptId":10052,"text":"“这下有些棘手了，这里的战车兽开始发生变异了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":968,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-EPILOGUE:10053:1","scriptId":10053,"text":"“竟然会有能模仿人类行为的战车兽，我有不好的预感。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1158,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"106006-EPILOGUE:10053:2","scriptId":10053,"text":"“这下有些棘手了，这里的战车兽开始发生变异了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1158,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["唉……这基地怎么那么破，连电都没有？供电所可是在郊区啊，走不动了……但是夺回电场还是必须要做的。","供电所外围有那么多战车兽，要绕过他们好像不是很容易，不过找个相对薄弱点的突破口对我来说还是小菜一碟的。","战车兽懂得修理电力装置？这些生物的智力应该没那么高才对，是不是有些战车兽发生变异了？"]}
